{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object is visible, approach and grab it. Move to destination and check its properties before completing specific task. list of available nodes: <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = GrabObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectInGrip    /> <Action ID = MoveToDestination    /> <Action ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <SubTree ID = SpecificTask    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    />\"",
